{
  "id": "cdcp_00578",
  "corpus": "cdcp",
  "text": "If there already isn't a law or rule at the fed level for when what happens to time barred debts when a debtor leaves the purview of one states SOL and now resides in another states SOL, there needs to be. It should be clear that if a debtor changes states, which SOL should come into play.",
